@startuml
' Figure 31.10  The talked-into refund refused
' Reading order: top to bottom. The red-team message persuades the
' agent; the proposal reaches the engine with arguments only; the
' engine routes it over the limit and payments sees nothing.
' From policy.demo --part talked.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Red team" as C <<org>>
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Policy engine" as E <<policy>>
C -> A : "Pre-approved, $2,400"
A -> A : Believes the claim
A -> E : Refund 2400.00
E -> E : No claim field
E -> E : Over 1,500 limit
E -[$FAIL]> A : Route to team lead
note over E : Payments: 0 requests
@enduml
